<speak>
<s>This is your briefing for <say-as interpret-as="date" format="dmy">19042026</say-as>.</s>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="95%">
<s>President Trump says the bombs resume Wednesday if no deal is reached with Iran, as Pakistan prepares to host a second round of talks in Islamabad Monday.</s> <s>Iran controls the Strait of Hormuz, the chokepoint carrying twenty percent of the world's oil, and it's rejected any American-imposed terms on transit.</s> <s>The ten-day ceasefire expires in days, with Tehran's blockade demands still unresolved.</s>
</prosody>
<p>
<s>In politics.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>A new report from a <sub alias="United States">US</sub> refugee agency finds the Iran war has stranded nearly two million Afghans who'd taken refuge inside Iran, exceeding worst-case humanitarian projections.</s> <s>Populations already displaced by earlier conflicts, including Iraqi Kurds and Pakistani returnees, are bearing the sharpest costs.</s> <s>Washington's humanitarian bureau, formed in March to coordinate the response, is already overwhelmed.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Sudan's war has entered its third year, and measles deaths are mounting daily in the displacement camps of Darfur.</s> <s>The army retook Khartoum without rebuilding water systems, and a Mahamid commander has defected from the Rapid Support Forces, defying the group's leader Dagalo.</s> <s>Medical sources warn dengue could worsen as the rainy season approaches.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Twelve states, including Pakistan, have condemned Israel's appointment of a diplomatic envoy to Somaliland.</s> <s>Israel recognised the breakaway region in December, becoming the first country to do so, and the Arab League calls the move a violation of Somali territorial integrity.</s> <s>Washington defended the appointment at the Security Council, turning recognition itself into a tool of foreign-policy leverage.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>India has summoned Tehran's ambassador after Iranian gunboats fired on two Indian-flagged tankers in the Strait of Hormuz.</s> <s>New Delhi is among Iran's largest crude buyers and spent much of the war quietly resisting American pressure.</s> <s>That calculus shifts when your own vessels are under fire.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>In Budapest, Péter Magyar has ended sixteen years of Orbán rule, a result that quietly unlocks a decade of stalled European business.</s> <s>Hungary's veto blocked <sub alias="European Union">EU</sub> climate finance and Russian-energy decoupling for years, because unanimity rules gave one capital a brake on twenty-six others.</s> <s>Magyar's pledged a Russian-energy exit by twenty thirty-five, and his win quietly reshapes the continent's agenda.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>In London, an official cleared Peter Mandelson for office without informing a single minister, even after security vetting refused him in January twenty twenty-five over Epstein ties and China lobbying.</s> <s>Prime Minister Starmer fired civil servant Olly Robbins on Friday.</s> <s>Robbins testifies before parliament next week on whether Starmer knew.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>North Korea fired its fourth ballistic missile barrage of April from Sinpo, the seventh launch this year.</s> <s>A Kyungnam University analyst said Pyongyang views American focus on Iran as a golden window to upgrade its capability.</s> <s>Trump and Xi meet in mid-May, and the North wants its new hardware ready before that conversation begins.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>On the economy.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>India's jet fuel price has doubled overnight, with state oil companies hiking aviation turbine fuel by one hundred and fifteen percent to a record high.</s> <s>Fuel accounts for forty percent of airline costs, and carriers are already flying longer detour routes around West Asia.</s> <s>The International Air Transport Association confirmed fare increases, and new fuel surcharges are expected within days.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Indian bank stocks have shed ninety-five billion dollars since March, as the Reserve Bank's defense of the rupee after the Iran oil shock froze domestic liquidity.</s> <s>Jefferies estimates another six hundred million dollars in currency-trade unwind losses ahead, and Fitch forecasts margin compression through March twenty twenty-seven.</s> <s>The Nifty Bank index is already down sharply, with no clear floor in sight.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Pakistan returns three and a half billion dollars to Abu Dhabi this month, repaying twenty nineteen emergency deposits at Emirati insistence.</s> <s>The move cuts central bank reserves by eighteen percent, and analysts warn it'll pressure the rupee and jeopardize <sub alias="International Monetary Fund">IMF</sub> reserve requirements.</s> <s>Meanwhile in Karachi, the Iranian rial's quadrupled against the rupee since the war began, as Balochistan importers paying for smuggled petroleum drove rates from twenty-five hundred to ten thousand rupees per ten million rial.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Washington has renewed a thirty-day waiver on Russian oil sanctions, reversing Treasury Secretary Bessent on Friday.</s> <s>The International Energy Agency calls the Iran war the worst global energy shock in history, and Asian buyers pressed Washington to keep Russian barrels flowing.</s> <s>In Milan, Italy's deputy prime minister Matteo Salvini is citing that waiver as justification for Europe to resume Russian gas imports of its own.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>In upstate New York, the bitcoin firm <sub alias="N Y D I G">NYDIG</sub> is converting Alcoa's idle Massena smelter into a bitcoin mine.</s> <s>American aluminum can't compete on global pricing, and the dedicated hydropower grids built for smelting are now worth more as compute infrastructure.</s> <s>Alcoa's chief executive expects the deal to close mid-year, with more idle smelters to follow.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>In Melbourne, the state of Victoria is forgoing five hundred and two million dollars in fare revenue through year-end, extending free public transport and halving fares citywide.</s> <s>Premier Jacinta Allan cited Gulf fuel costs as justification, covering the state's entire transit network.</s> <s>A state budget due in May must quantify whether this becomes a political ratchet that can't be unwound.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In science.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Researchers in Dhaka have found that dissolved sodium in coastal tap water raises blood pressure independently of dietary salt.</s> <s>The study links saline groundwater, worsened by rising seas, to elevated hypertension across coastal communities from the Bangladeshi delta to the Nile.</s> <s>Current medical guidelines don't account for what people drink, which means the Global South's climate burden is quietly accumulating inside bodies.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>At Kitt Peak in Arizona, researchers have completed the largest three-dimensional map of the universe ever made.</s> <s>The Dark Energy Spectroscopic Instrument's five thousand fibre-optic sensors measured cosmic expansion across billions of light-years, and early results hint that dark energy itself may be weakening over time.</s> <s>If that holds, the standard model of cosmology needs rewriting.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>In Paris, the European Space Agency's Rosalind Franklin rover will finally launch six years behind schedule, aboard a SpaceX Falcon Heavy in late twenty twenty-eight.</s> <s>Russia's twenty twenty-two invasion of Ukraine cancelled the original Roscosmos ride, stranding the life-seeking mission in a clean room.</s> <s>Washington's twenty twenty-seven budget proposes cutting Mars contributions, and European space autonomy looks increasingly like a fiction.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Seismologists in Seattle have found that subduction zones, not ocean currents, drive the cycling of ancient microbes through Earth's deep biosphere.</s> <s>Pressure-driven fluid in earthquake megathrusts carries dormant organisms upward across millions of years.</s> <s>The finding reassigns a role long attributed to the oceans themselves.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In technology.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>The Federal Aviation Administration has dropped civil and criminal penalties for flying drones near <sub alias="I C E">ICE</sub> immigration vehicles, following a journalist's lawsuit.</s> <s>But agencies retain the right to destroy any drone they deem a threat, and the protected-agency list has expanded to include the Justice Department.</s> <s>Filming is now legal, but the aircraft can still be shot down without recourse.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Meta is cutting eight thousand workers despite reporting twelve billion dollars in quarterly profit, redirecting headcount budget to artificial intelligence infrastructure.</s> <s>The first round begins on the twentieth of May, with a second round planned for later this year.</s> <s>The company has not officially confirmed either figure.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Frozen gametes now routinely produce children after their parents have died, and legal systems haven't kept pace.</s> <s>Posthumous conception raises unsettled questions of consent, inheritance, and the child's own identity rights.</s> <s>Reproductive medicine bodies face pressure to establish standards before courts are forced to write them instead.</s>
</p>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="90%">
<s>That's your briefing.</s>
</prosody>
</speak>